!.gitignore

# Only the specific demo assets below are tracked — anything else dropped
# into these folders (e.g. test uploads made through the Filament admin
# while developing locally) stays untracked by default. This is what kept
# real test-upload files out of git before; new demo files must be added
# here explicitly rather than switching to a blanket "!products/*" rule.
